  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: 'Hey, you think you can give me some money for food? Me and Lucas wanna
      go to that new Italian place later with Bradley, but we already spent all our
      money on snacks. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: "Ah\u2026 But I don\u2019t have all that much money on me, and I need it
      to buy a new notebook for my studysession\u2026"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Oh come on, you don\u2019t really need a new notebook, do you, nerd? Just
      do us that favour to help cheer our friend up. Maybe I\u2019ll even consider
      letting you and your little boyfriend go for a week, huh? "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: 'Yeah, surely, you would like that, right? Just give us your money. The
      alternative is that we dunk your little nerd head in the toilet and just take
      it anyway. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "You\u2019re supposed to be smart, so surely you see the easier choice
      to take here, right? "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: "Ah, uhmm\u2026 A- alright\u2026 "
    videoEventId: 
